    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37690" root="لذب" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَذَبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَذُبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُذُوبٌ</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاذَبَ</span></b> ; <i>He
remained, stayed, abode,</i> or <i>dwelt,</i> in a place:
(K:) or correctly written with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">د</span>, unpointed:
but IDrd doubts whether correctly with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذ</span> or
with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">د</span>. (TA.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزَبَ</span>.

